<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Accès refusé — TanaClean 2035</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
  <style>
    .desktop-only-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: var(--color-bg);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: var(--sp-6);
    }
    .desktop-only-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-modal);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .desktop-only-header {
      background: var(--color-brand);
      padding: var(--sp-8) var(--sp-8) var(--sp-6);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .desktop-only-icon {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto var(--sp-4);
    }
    .desktop-only-header h1 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 var(--sp-1);
    }
    .desktop-only-header p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .desktop-only-body {
      padding: var(--sp-8);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .desktop-only-body p {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      color: var(--color-text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
    }
    .desktop-only-body .hint {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: var(--color-text-subtle);
      background: var(--color-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
    }
    .desktop-only-body .hint code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--color-brand);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }
    .logo-text {
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-top: var(--sp-3);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="desktop-only-page">
  <div class="desktop-only-card">

    <div class="desktop-only-header">
      <div class="desktop-only-icon">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
             stroke="white" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>Accès réservé</h1>
      <p>Version desktop — Administrateurs uniquement</p>
      <div class="logo-text">TanaClean 2035</div>
    </div>

    <div class="desktop-only-body">
      <p>
        Cette application desktop est <strong>réservée aux administrateurs</strong>
        du système TanaClean 2035.
      </p>

      <div class="hint">
        Vous êtes <strong>éboueur</strong> ou <strong>citoyen</strong> ?<br>
        Connectez-vous depuis votre navigateur web à l'adresse :<br>
        <code>http://localhost:3131</code>
      </div>

      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="justify-content:center;width:100%;padding:10px;text-decoration:none;display:flex">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
             stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
             style="margin-right:8px">
          <path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/>
        </svg>
        Retour à la connexion
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
